WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:04.020
Whether your financial goal is getting out
of debt, saving for retirement, or starting

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:08.810
your own business, you’ll be facing as many
pitfalls and obstacles as a dungeon-crawling

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:09.880
treasure-seeker.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.120
But no hero has to go it alone.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.450
Frodo had the fellowship.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:14.780
Harry had Ron and Hermione.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.180
Eleven had the Hawkins Middle AV Club

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:22.100
So if you want to slay your money monsters,
you may want to assemble a financial fellowship of

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.160
of your own.

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:35.140
Each Financial Dream Team will be a little
different, depending on your needs.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:39.230
But here are some of the most important roles
you might want to fill before embarking

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:43.160
into the great unknown.

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:46.730
Plotting a course through the tax-code can
be as confusing as charting a path through

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:47.790
the Dead Marshes.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:53.750
A recent study shows that while 34% of tax-filers
choose to use a digital tool (like Turbo Tax)

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:56.830
to self file, 28% use an accountant.

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:58.470
So, do you need one?

00:00:58.470 --> 00:01:04.030
If your financial situation is uncomplicated,
such as a W2 job with a set-salary, you’ll

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:07.080
probably be just fine with an digital tax-filing
service.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:11.990
But if your financial year was full of twists
and turns, like running a small business,

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:15.830
helping a child with tuition, or owning
a rental property, you should probably consider

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:19.540
partnering with an Enrolled Agent or Certified
Public Accountant.

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:25.270
An EA can help you file your tax return, while
a CPA is required to have a comprehensive

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:28.350
knowledge of taxes, auditing, and business
law.

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:33.000
If an expert navigator can help you avoid
even one wrong turn, they might easily save

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:37.040
you thousands of dollars.

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:38.890
Nobody likes paying for insurance.

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:43.480
But think of it like stocking up on armor
or healing potions you hope to never use.

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:47.920
You’ll be thanking your lucky stars if life
ends up throwing you a nasty curveball like

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.980
a disability or a house-fire.

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:55.180
A licensed insurance agent may specialize
in protecting against bodily risks, material

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:57.510
damage, or the threat of a lawsuit.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:03.330
Remember that agents are paid by commission,
typically 8-16% in the US, so be wary of any

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:04.330
up-sells.

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:08.950
An independent insurance agent will allow
you to shop around for multiple policies and

00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:12.950
compare prices and benefits.

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:16.560
This situation calls for a master of the mystical
arts.

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:20.010
Somebody that speaks the arcane language Legalese.

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:21.360
We need a Lawyer.

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:27.290
A trusted attorney can help you craft magic
scrolls--I mean, contracts or wills, set up

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:32.920
a business entity, and back you up in a tight
legal situation.

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:38.090
And knowing just one attorney will often give
you access to their database of other attorneys.

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:43.440
Just ask and odds are you’ll get another
great specialist for your situation.

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:47.430
Ever wish you had a wise old expert to nudge
you in the right direction?

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:50.980
Then maybe it’s time you sought out a Professional
Mentor.

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:53.900
You want someone that’s been in your shoes
before.

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:57.730
It might be somebody that graduated from your
Master’s program or that launched a business

00:02:57.730 --> 00:02:58.890
like yours.

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:02.920
Let them know how much you admire them and
ask if they’d let you take them to breakfast

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:04.099
once per month.

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:09.940
You might be surprised at what people will
do for a chance to share their story.

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:12.590
Who’s going to wrangle all the experts you’re
recruiting?

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:14.920
That’s where the Financial Planner comes
in.

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:19.610
While some financial planners primarily focus
on investments and money-management, a true

00:03:19.610 --> 00:03:25.760
“captain” of your team should take holistic view of your finances and be able to command all the moving parts.

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:31.260
The “CFP” is the premier certification
for financial advisers and it's barer is often called

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:33.269
the “Master Generalist”.

00:03:33.269 --> 00:03:38.390
Their knowledge often runs more broad than
deep - from retirement to investments, estate

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:39.390
planning to insurance.

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:44.680
They can help you make sure all the pieces
of your party are aiming for the same goals.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:49.240
Financial planners can be compensated one
of three ways - commission for recommending

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:55.260
financial products, a fee (flat or percentage
of your investments), or a hybrid of both

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:57.490
(also known as fee-based).

00:03:57.490 --> 00:04:02.480
Whatever you choose, make certain your financial
advisor is a sworn “fiduciary”, who will

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:05.330
put your financial needs over their own.

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:09.269
Unlike Frodo’s fellowship, these companions
won’t follow you for nothing.

00:04:09.269 --> 00:04:10.980
Most of them will need to be paid.

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:14.940
But the shortcuts they’ll find and the traps
they’ll disarm will save you money in the

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:15.940
long run.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:19.959
Best of all, you’ll have the peace of mind
knowing that somebody’s got your back.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:22.020
And that may be what makes all the difference.

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:24.020
And that’s our two cents!

